    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the endless world of Steinstern. Explore increasingly large procedural mazes and unlock the doors. Find and upgrade weapons and level-up your ship to stand a chance against the increasingly difficult enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 Collect EXP to upgrade your ship with randomized level-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Find weapons in different rarities (used &lt; normal &lt; good &lt; rare &lt; epic &lt; legendary) with special attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Buy, sell or upgrade weapons at the  workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offers a wide range of difficulties from 'very easy' \ud83d\udc76 to 'very hard' \ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both keyboard  and mouse [\u2328\ufe0f+\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f] or gamepad [\ud83c\udfae] will work equally well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable in locale coop with dynamic split-screen \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f with two controllers [\ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfae] on the same PC .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83c\udfb2 Every run is different with randomized maps, enemies, weapons and level-ups.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way through quadrangular and hexangular mazes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/edc4dc9b3b2430b835fb6d67905bf535.avif?t=1753740196\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd13 Unlock the\u00a0doors by guessing the right combination:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/18d3e74112f3f1e67c7c0f134aaa2384.poster.avif?t=1753740196\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/18d3e74112f3f1e67c7c0f134aaa2384.webm?t=1753740196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/18d3e74112f3f1e67c7c0f134aaa2384.mp4?t=1753740196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/fdfd81d87864877f355367f445c6a097.poster.avif?t=1753740196\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/fdfd81d87864877f355367f445c6a097.webm?t=1753740196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/fdfd81d87864877f355367f445c6a097.mp4?t=1753740196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> ... or by throwing the ball\u00a0\ud83c\udfc0 in the basket \ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/15f1375f17c379c2a7b74d21a0b5e642.poster.avif?t=1753740196\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/15f1375f17c379c2a7b74d21a0b5e642.webm?t=1753740196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/15f1375f17c379c2a7b74d21a0b5e642.mp4?t=1753740196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f You can buy, sell or upgrade weapons at the workshop:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/cf3280adbde488acf0cafc67278fef1e.avif?t=1753740196\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the endless world of Steinstern. Explore increasingly large procedural mazes and unlock the doors. Find and upgrade weapons and level-up your ship to stand a chance against the increasingly difficult enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 Collect EXP to upgrade your ship with randomized level-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Find weapons in different rarities (used &lt; normal &lt; good &lt; rare &lt; epic &lt; legendary) with special attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Buy, sell or upgrade weapons at the  workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offers a wide range of difficulties from 'very easy' \ud83d\udc76 to 'very hard' \ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both keyboard  and mouse [\u2328\ufe0f+\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f] or gamepad [\ud83c\udfae] will work equally well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable in locale coop with dynamic split-screen \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f with two controllers [\ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfae] on the same PC .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83c\udfb2 Every run is different with randomized maps, enemies, weapons and level-ups.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way through quadrangular and hexangular mazes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/edc4dc9b3b2430b835fb6d67905bf535.avif?t=1753740196\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd13 Unlock the\u00a0doors by guessing the right combination:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/18d3e74112f3f1e67c7c0f134aaa2384.poster.avif?t=1753740196\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta